  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dignifying roads: Displaced women. Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transit of women in forced mobility exposes their lives to extreme risks impacting their safety, integrity and dignity. Their physical appearance, gender, social &amp; economic conditions are closely related to the consequences of these dangers. All of these factors leave a devastating impact on their mental, physical &amp; emotional health, resulting in deep and lasting scars. Join the effort to dignify the stories of migrant women in Chiapas, so that they can heal, rebuild, and forge their future.</narrative>
  </description>
